WEBVTT

00:14:28.822 --> 00:14:34.244
from worrying about whether
we're going to meet 2050 climate goals

00:14:34.244 --> 00:14:37.039
to how they look kind of lazy.

00:14:37.497 --> 00:14:39.499
We can do this.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.795
We've just got to drill the limit.

00:14:44.838 --> 00:14:45.964
Thank you.

00:14:46.006 --> 00:14:49.051
(Applause)